{"questionId":"u01-s001-v001","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列哪一個數是整數？","choices":["[[frac:2|5]]","−12","0.4","1.5"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"整數沒有非零的小數或分數部分。−12 是負整數；其餘三個數都有非零的小數或分數部分。","steps":["先找沒有非零小數或分數部分的數。","−12 符合整數的定義。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"[[frac:2|5]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:2|5]] 是有理數但不是整數。"},{"choice":"−12","truth":true,"reason":"−12 是負整數。"},{"choice":"0.4","truth":false,"reason":"0.4 是有限小數，不是整數。"},{"choice":"1.5","truth":false,"reason":"1.5 有非零小數部分，不是整數。"}],"commonMistake":"把負號誤認為不是整數。","concept":"負整數也是整數。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"45","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"辨認負整數，避免把負號和數的種類混淆。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"187e0b4729ef0e72a5c18bbed907d04a2fede948310bfb21080468fa92c5ba52"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v002","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列哪一個數是有理數但不是整數？","choices":["−7","0","[[frac:3|4]]","12"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"[[frac:3|4]] 可以寫成兩個整數相除，因此是有理數；它不能化成整數，所以是有理數但不是整數。","steps":["先排除整數 −7、0、12。","[[frac:3|4]] 是非整數有理數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"−7","truth":false,"reason":"−7 是整數。"},{"choice":"0","truth":false,"reason":"0 是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|4]]","truth":true,"reason":"[[frac:3|4]] 是有理數但不是整數。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"12 是整數。"}],"commonMistake":"看到分數就只說它不是整數，忘了它仍是有理數。","concept":"分數通常是非整數有理數。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"45","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"區分整數和非整數有理數。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"d7864f65e35cbf11991be1c0f420d7449cf9ddd68740cd1fafab1b03226cac53"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v003","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"關於 0 的分類，下列敘述何者正確？","choices":["0 是正整數","0 是負整數","0 不是有理數","0 是整數，也是有理數"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"0 是整數。又因為 0=[[frac:0|1]]，所以 0 也是有理數；但 0 不是正數，也不是負數。","steps":["確認 0 是否屬於整數：0 是整數。","把 0 寫成 [[frac:0|1]]，可知它也是有理數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"0 是正整數","truth":false,"reason":"0 不大於 0，所以不是正整數。"},{"choice":"0 是負整數","truth":false,"reason":"0 不小於 0，所以不是負整數。"},{"choice":"0 不是有理數","truth":false,"reason":"0=[[frac:0|1]]，因此是有理數。"},{"choice":"0 是整數，也是有理數","truth":true,"reason":"這是正確敘述。"}],"commonMistake":"把 0 誤歸入正數或負數。","concept":"0 是整數與有理數，但不是正數或負數。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"45","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"建立 0 的正確分類。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"2819d5b2a91c720b887cc2b91685a476a446be54363055f1c20d0034cd1ecc12"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v004","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列哪一個分數化簡後是整數？","choices":["[[frac:12|3]]","[[frac:5|2]]","[[frac:7|4]]","[[frac:9|6]]"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"[[frac:12|3]]=4，化簡後沒有分數部分，所以是整數。","steps":["逐一化簡四個分數。","只有 [[frac:12|3]]=4 是整數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"[[frac:12|3]]","truth":true,"reason":"[[frac:12|3]]=4，是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:5|2]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:5|2]]=2.5，不是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:7|4]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:7|4]]=1.75，不是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:9|6]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:9|6]]=[[frac:3|2]]=1.5，不是整數。"}],"commonMistake":"看到分數形式就直接判斷不是整數。","concept":"分數表示法有時會化成整數。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"要求先化簡再分類。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"b2f100777990c253188bef4b62819de043eb8867342c706a4282cf92e986814a"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v005","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列分類何者正確？","choices":["[[frac:3|2]] 是整數","0.6 是整數","−8 是整數，也是有理數","[[frac:5|4]] 不是有理數"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"−8 是負整數，因此是整數；每個整數都可寫成分母為 1 的分數，所以 −8 也是有理數。","steps":["逐項檢查是否有非零分數部分。","再利用「每個整數都是有理數」判斷。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"[[frac:3|2]] 是整數","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:3|2]]=1.5，不是整數。"},{"choice":"0.6 是整數","truth":false,"reason":"0.6 不是整數。"},{"choice":"−8 是整數，也是有理數","truth":true,"reason":"−8 是整數，也是有理數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:5|4]] 不是有理數","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:5|4]] 是有理數。"}],"commonMistake":"認為整數和有理數是互不相交的兩類。","concept":"整數是有理數的一部分。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"理解整數包含於有理數。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"470603417117edfef61fd2ad58de05c75b48cb961e7a9e55ceb4531ae3f8879d"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v006","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"0.35 化成最簡分數為何？","choices":["[[frac:35|10]]","[[frac:7|20]]","[[frac:3|5]]","[[frac:35|1000]]"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"0.35=[[frac:35|100]]。分子和分母同除以 5，得到最簡分數 [[frac:7|20]]。","steps":["兩位小數先寫成 [[frac:35|100]]。","分子和分母同除以 5。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"[[frac:35|10]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:35|10]]=3.5，不等於 0.35。"},{"choice":"[[frac:7|20]]","truth":true,"reason":"[[frac:7|20]]=0.35，且已最簡。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|5]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:3|5]]=0.6。"},{"choice":"[[frac:35|1000]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:35|1000]]=0.035。"}],"commonMistake":"小數位數和分母的 0 個數不一致。","concept":"有限小數可化成分母為 10 的次方的分數。","tags":["數與量","有限小數","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"把有限小數精確改寫為最簡分數。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"67698e4eb23e6686642b6e19ffd5aba45d13f7a863329a0abd394f9e9baec6f8"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v007","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列哪一組中的四個數，恰有兩個是整數？","choices":["−3、0、[[frac:1|2]]、2.5","−3、[[frac:8|4]]、6、0","[[frac:3|2]]、0.4、−1.2、[[frac:7|5]]","0、[[frac:9|3]]、−4、12"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"第一組中的 −3 和 0 是整數，[[frac:1|2]] 和 2.5 不是整數，所以恰有兩個整數。","steps":["逐組先化簡分數。","計算每組整數的個數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"−3、0、[[frac:1|2]]、2.5","truth":true,"reason":"恰有 −3、0 兩個整數。"},{"choice":"−3、[[frac:8|4]]、6、0","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:8|4]]=2，因此四個數都是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|2]]、0.4、−1.2、[[frac:7|5]]","truth":false,"reason":"四個數都不是整數。"},{"choice":"0、[[frac:9|3]]、−4、12","truth":false,"reason":"四個數都是整數。"}],"commonMistake":"沒有先把 [[frac:8|4]]、[[frac:9|3]] 化簡。","concept":"分類前要先化簡。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"同時處理分數化簡與整數計數。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"3c10c759c8f03d8fc4503c39a2a867ec59610490858caa7490b5d43f0f74cbc5"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v008","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"下列敘述何者一定正確？","choices":["每個有理數都是整數","每個有限小數都不是有理數","每個分數都不是整數","每個整數都是有理數"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"任一整數 n 都可以寫成 [[frac:n|1]]，所以每個整數都是有理數。","steps":["找出不可能被反例推翻的敘述。","整數可寫成分母為 1 的分數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"每個有理數都是整數","truth":false,"reason":"例如 [[frac:1|2]] 是有理數但不是整數。"},{"choice":"每個有限小數都不是有理數","truth":false,"reason":"有限小數可以化成分數，因此是有理數。"},{"choice":"每個分數都不是整數","truth":false,"reason":"例如 [[frac:8|4]]=2，是整數。"},{"choice":"每個整數都是有理數","truth":true,"reason":"這是一定正確的敘述。"}],"commonMistake":"把「整數都是有理數」誤讀成「有理數都是整數」。","concept":"整數集合包含在有理數集合中。","tags":["數與量","集合關係","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"利用反例辨認集合包含關係。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"ae5809b802256f7f7059dfcd5c0e58eb052dfd0dd83a676e2ff4dc2c7955e0a0"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v009","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"已知 x＝−18÷6，則 x 的分類何者正確？","choices":["x 是有理數但不是整數","x 是整數，也是有理數","x 是有限小數但不是有理數","無法判斷"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"−18÷6=−3。−3 是負整數，因此也是有理數。","steps":["先計算 x=−3。","再依結果分類。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"x 是有理數但不是整數","truth":false,"reason":"−3 是整數，不只是非整數有理數。"},{"choice":"x 是整數，也是有理數","truth":true,"reason":"−3 是整數，也是有理數。"},{"choice":"x 是有限小數但不是有理數","truth":false,"reason":"−3 不是有限小數形式，而且所有有限小數本來就是有理數。"},{"choice":"無法判斷","truth":false,"reason":"已可由算式求出 x。"}],"commonMistake":"算出負數後，誤以為負數不是整數。","concept":"先計算，再分類。","tags":["數與量","數的分類","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"結合簡單除法與分類。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"00361c584f6399f3054ab1176eb3a4442eda53c3c0c1dea83306f265f39ab28a"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v010","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"某系統只能以「整數或最簡分數」精確儲存數值。下列哪一筆資料需要先改寫，才能符合格式？","choices":["−8","[[frac:3|5]]","0.75","12"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"0.75 是有限小數，數值可以精確改寫成 [[frac:3|4]]；其餘三筆已經是整數或最簡分數。","steps":["確認系統接受的兩種格式。","把 0.75 改寫成 [[frac:3|4]]。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"−8","truth":false,"reason":"−8 已是整數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|5]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:3|5]] 已是最簡分數。"},{"choice":"0.75","truth":true,"reason":"0.75 需要改寫為 [[frac:3|4]]。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"12 已是整數。"}],"commonMistake":"把「需要改寫格式」誤認成「不能精確表示」。","concept":"有限小數能精確改寫成分數。","tags":["數與量","資料格式","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"在資料格式情境中使用有限小數與分數的等值關係。","literacyContextNecessity":"系統格式限制使學生必須判斷數值類型並進行等值改寫。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"f6e15892dd5b3d044c4407993050b7a7f771d0ba69b246f7d807ef7f567d28df"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v011","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"倉庫以「箱」為單位記錄完整箱數。下列哪一筆紀錄可以表示完整箱數？","choices":["18","18.5","[[frac:3|4]]","0.2"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"完整箱數必須是非負整數。18 是整數；其餘數值都表示不足一整箱的部分。","steps":["找出情境要求：完整箱數。","在四個數中辨認非負整數 18。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"18","truth":true,"reason":"18 可以表示 18 個完整箱子。"},{"choice":"18.5","truth":false,"reason":"18.5 含半箱，不是完整箱數。"},{"choice":"[[frac:3|4]]","truth":false,"reason":"[[frac:3|4]] 不到一整箱。"},{"choice":"0.2","truth":false,"reason":"0.2 不到一整箱。"}],"commonMistake":"只看數值是正的，就忽略完整物件數必須是整數。","concept":"離散物件的完整數量通常用非負整數表示。","tags":["數與量","離散數量","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"把整數分類連結到完整物件的計數。","literacyContextNecessity":"完整箱數是離散數量，情境限制使整數判斷不可省略。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"3f38dd66032a049cd015d10103218a98ca033dc760becb8f53e9b3d9a8da346e"}
{"questionId":"u01-s001-v012","unitId":"u01","numericUnitId":1,"topicId":"u01-integer-basics","skillId":"integer-number-classification","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"資料表記錄四個數：−4、0.75、[[frac:6|3]]、−1.2。下列分類何者正確？","choices":["四個數都是整數","只有 0.75 是整數","−4、0.75 是整數","−4、[[frac:6|3]] 是整數，0.75、−1.2 是非整數有理數"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"−4 是整數；[[frac:6|3]]=2，也是整數。0.75 和 −1.2 都是有限小數，因此是有理數但不是整數。","steps":["先化簡 [[frac:6|3]]=2。","再分別判斷整數與非整數有理數。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"四個數都是整數","truth":false,"reason":"0.75 和 −1.2 不是整數。"},{"choice":"只有 0.75 是整數","truth":false,"reason":"0.75 不是整數。"},{"choice":"−4、0.75 是整數","truth":false,"reason":"0.75 不是整數，且 [[frac:6|3]] 是整數。"},{"choice":"−4、[[frac:6|3]] 是整數，0.75、−1.2 是非整數有理數","truth":true,"reason":"這個分類完整且正確。"}],"commonMistake":"沒有先化簡 [[frac:6|3]]，或把負有限小數誤判為整數。","concept":"資料分類前先化簡，再看是否有非零小數部分。","tags":["數與量","資料判讀","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"90","prerequisiteSkillIds":[],"authoringIntent":"在資料表情境中同時分類整數與非整數有理數。","literacyContextNecessity":"需要整理多筆資料並依同一分類規則做一致判斷。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","contentSha256":"fdac19f72144be13b10118de508ae91b34abfda7b33137cb835dd8e2b1a8939e"}
